{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1486160870,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyMDUyODY1NTM=","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1256","origin":"github"},"title":"publish --since=None (default) should consider only changes since last push","message":"Originally reported in https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1250#issuecomment-277379955\n\nThe point of having --since is to minimize amount of work needed based on the changes since the last push, while being able to force it to consider more changes by providing explicit value for --since.  Recent refactoring in publish seems removed that magic, and now with empty since nothing might get published at all, although current one was ahead of the remote\n\nhere is a copy from that other report:\n```shell\n(git)smaug:/mnt/btrfs/datasets/datalad/crawl[master]git\n$\u003e datalad publish --to=datalad-public -r\nNothing was published\n```\nwhich is really sad since\n```shell\n$\u003e git lg datalad-public/master..master \n* 624430e - (HEAD -\u003e master) [DATALAD] aggregated meta data (24 minutes ago) [Yaroslav Halchenko]\n* ae4afa5 - [DATALAD] auto-saved changes (26 minutes ago) [Yaroslav Halchenko]\n* 7a4bd3a - fixed up json (34 minutes ago) [Yaroslav Halchenko]\n* 3b37735 - [DATALAD] aggregated meta data (7 days ago) [Yaroslav Halchenko]\n* 4a9e730 - [DATALAD] auto-saved changes (7 days ago) [Yaroslav Halchenko]\n```\nand so `--since` should have done correct detection as it did before (I think)... and indeed probably since now is handled only if explicitly specified.  So I deactivated virtualenv and went back to released 0.4.1, and it did the right thing:\n```shell\n$\u003e datalad publish --to=datalad-public -r\n[INFO   ] Publishing \u003cDataset path=/mnt/btrfs/datasets/datalad/crawl/labs/haxby/raiders\u003e to datalad-public \n[INFO   ] 3bf7193..07861d6\n|  \n[INFO   ] f5d4b54..df51dc4\n|  \n[INFO   ] Publishing \u003cDataset path=/mnt/btrfs/datasets/datalad/crawl/labs/haxby\u003e to datalad-public \n[INFO   ] c88cc54..f0f80c2\n|  \n[INFO   ] Publishing \u003cDataset path=/mnt/btrfs/datasets/datalad/crawl/labs/mitchell/science2008\u003e to datalad-public \n[INFO   ] a1bb300..514aa4a\n...\n```","files":null}]}